# The simulator's card and internal flash: all of it is local state and none of it belongs in git. sd/ holds downloaded books
# (tools/fetch-books.sh) and paperos_config with the Home Assistant token and Wi-Fi password; data/ holds wifi.json (passwords),
# the inbox cache (private messages), power.csv, refresh.log, app state. Test data lives in tests/ui/data and tests/fixtures.
